	(text "LED target I is 5mA\n\nFor a white LED, Vf = 3.2V\n\nR = (Vbatt - Vf) / I\nR = (8.4 - 3.2) / 5ma = 1040 (~1k)\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 56.388 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "58a5cf96-d957-4f6b-bc75-df1b4c0ac17a")
	)
	(text "For Q2, Q4\n\nIn the OFF state, the gate sees VBATT\nR7 and R8 form a voltage divider to produce Vg\n\nVg = Vbatt * (R10 / (R10 + R7))\nThe AO3400A has an abs. maximum Vg of 12V, our VBATT is 7.4V (max 8.4V)\nA good target Vg is 3-5 V. \n\nR7 = R10(Vbatt / Vg - 1)\nR7 = 10k(8.4 / 4) - 1 = 11k (~10k)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.854 131.064 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "93a6fd5c-e952-4baf-8b0c-020074f5c402")
	)
	(text "TVS diode should have V_rwm >= 1.2 (Vbatt)\nV_rwm >= 1.2(8.4 V) = 10V\nSelect a TVS with a SMAJ10A (10V V_rwm, 11.1 V_br)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 56.134 124.968 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a1190fc3-5059-4fc4-ab53-f3df9b6eabd3")
	)
